# Keep text files LF on every runner: the embedded catalog manifest hashes
# raw JSON bytes, and a CRLF checkout would make Windows CI disagree with the
# committed manifest. Batch files stay CRLF for cmd.exe.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
*.wasm binary
*.deflate binary
